00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:11,000
بِسْمِ اللّٰهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ || Dengan nama Allah Yang Maha Pengasih, Maha Penyayang || Kalihan asma Allah ingkang Maha Asih, Maha Welas || In the name of Allah, the Most Gracious, the Most Merciful
2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:23,180
قُلْ اَعُوْذُ بِرَبِّ النَّاسِۙ (١) || Katakanlah, “Aku berlindung kepada Tuhannya manusia, || Ngendika: “Aku nyuwun perlindungan marang Gusti wong-wong, || Say, "I seek refuge in the Lord of mankind,
3
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:31,140
مَلِكِ النَّاسِۙ (٢) || Raja manusia, || Raja wong-wong, || The Sovereign of mankind.
4
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:39,140
اِلٰهِ النَّاسِۙ (٣) || sembahan manusia, || Sembahan wong-wong, || The God of mankind,
5
00:00:39,140 --> 00:00:51,230
مِنْ شَرِّ الْوَسْوَاسِ ەۙ الْخَنَّاسِۖ (٤) || dari kejahatan (bisikan) setan yang bersembunyi, || saka kejahatan (bisikan) setan sing ndhelik, || From the evil of the retreating whisperer -
6
00:00:51,230 --> 00:01:03,290
الَّذِيْ يُوَسْوِسُ فِيْ صُدُوْرِ النَّاسِۙ (٥) || yang membisikkan (kejahatan) ke dalam dada manusia, || sing mbisikake (kejahatan) ing sajroning dada wong-wong, || Who whispers [evil] into the breasts of mankind -
7
00:01:03,290 --> 00:01:15,227
مِنَ الْجِنَّةِ وَالنَّاسِ ࣖ (٦) || dari (golongan) jin dan manusia.” || saka (golongan) jin lan wong.” || From among the jinn and mankind."
